  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0032","literal","Soldiers' encampments wells stoves food drink asked illness medicine, personally stroked and comforted them.","As for the soldiers' encampments, wells, stoves, food and drink, and inquiries about illness and medicine, he personally stroked and comforted them.","士卒次舍井灶飲食問疾醫藥，身自拊循之 is a topic–comment line: the welfare list is topicalized and 身自拊循之 means he personally stroked and comforted the soldiers; the before is ungrammatical telegraphic English, and the proposed after restores that structure without inventing or omitting sense.","high","applied"],
    ["s0033","literal","All took general's provisions to feast soldiers, body shared rations equally with soldiers.","He took all the general's provisions to feast the soldiers, and personally shared the rations equally with the soldiers.","悉取將軍之資糧享士卒 means he took all the general's provisions to feast the soldiers (悉 modifies 取, not a plural subject), and 身與士卒平分糧食 means he personally shared rations equally with them; the before's 'All took' and calque 'body' are wrong, and the proposed after matches the Chinese.","high","applied"]
  ],
